    description: Game design, game jams, projets personnels et professionnels.
  - id: vr
    label: "R\xE9alit\xE9 virtuelle"
    category: 1
    description: "Applications immersives et exp\xE9riences VR."
  - id: maintenance
    label: Maintenance & Support informatique
